SUMMARY:Room 861 at Goodnights: Calimar White
LOCATION:Goodnights Comedy Club\, 401 Woodburn Rd.\, Raleigh
DESCRIPTION:Originally from St. Petersburg\, Florida & currently based in A
 tlanta\, Calimar is a hilarious standup comic\, actor\, influencer & busine
 ss owner. Most known for his real-life videos that often go viral\, he has 
 taken the world by storm via his company OCDA where he confronts managers i
 n the workplace with real complaints submitted by their fellow employees. H
 is digital footprint continues to rapidly increase with over 1.3 million fo
 llowers on TikTok and over 485k on Instagram.\n\nHe has shared the stage wi
 th A-list comedians such as Mike Epps\, 85 South (DC Young Fly\, Karlous Mi
 ller & Chico Bean)\, DeRay Davis\, Lavell Crawford\, Michael Blackson & oth
 ers\, and is now headlining his own comedy shows across the country.\n\nHe 
 has a hit viral song on Worldstar titled “Never Do S#!T” at Work” and
  most recently guest starred in T.I.’s sequel to Da Partments (Da Partmen
 ts 2).\n\nManagement reserves the right to prevent customers from entering 
 the facility who they deem disruptive or dangerous to other patrons.\nMore 
 info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/room-861-at-goodnights-cal
 imar-white/
